/P 390 0 R
/T (SCC low voltage cables are normally supplied with PVC type ST2 over sheath complying with IEC 60502 , and are colored black. Other colors may be provided to suit a range of installation considerations such as the effect of UV radiations and different soil conditions. Anti-termite formulations can also be supplied as well as graphite- coated over sheath where on-site DC testing of the sheath is required. Please contact our technical department for full details.)
/E (SCC low voltage cables are normally supplied with PVC type ST2 over sheath complying with IEC 60502 , and are colored black. Other colors may be provided to suit a range of installation considerations such as the effect of UV radiations and different soil conditions. Anti-termite formulations can also be supplied as well as graphite- coated over sheath where on-site DC testing of the sheath is required. Please contact our technical department for full details.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
