/T (It is usual to assume the same current carrying capacity for four core cables as for three core cables. Our calculated values are based actually on three core cables. These values are suitable with enough accuracy also for four core cables in most cases. Only for large four core cables in air the values may be found to be too conservative, due to the large cable surface and consequent high heat dissipation factor.)
/E (It is usual to assume the same current carrying capacity for four core cables as for three core cables. Our calculated values are based actually on three core cables. These values are suitable with enough accuracy also for four core cables in most cases. Only for large four core cables in air the values may be found to be too conservative, due to the large cable surface and consequent high heat dissipation factor.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [9]
