44937 0 obj
<<
/Title (All cable designs in this brochure adhere to IEC 60502, BS 6346, and BS 5467 standards. Saudi Cable Company also offers alternative designs to meet specialized requirements, including enhanced fire performance and environmental protection. Cables can be customized with alternative sheathing materials, colors, or made to customer specifications and recognized standards, particularly for low smoke and non-halogen materials. Please contact our Technology department, Product Management department to discuss your specific needs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 36333 0 R
/Next 46440 0 R
>>
endobj
