/Title (This brochure contains technical information on all SCC low voltage cables including PVC and XLPE insulations, armoured and un-armoured designs, single and multicore cables and the range of sheathing options. Cables are divided by insulation and armouring types. Each section contains the appropriate technical details and constructional data. Current carrying capacities and other electrical data applicable to low voltage cables, in addition to cable handling instructions are at the end of this brochure.)
